    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24563" root="صقب" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْقَبُ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, near</i>]. One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا أَصْقَبُ مِنْ هٰذَا</span> <i>This is nearer than this:</i>
(M: [and the like is said in the A and TA:]) and
so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْقَبُ</span>. (M, TA. *)

